    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present 6 Coill Mhara, a spacious four-bedroom detached residence ideally located within this highly sought-after and mature residential development in Shannon.\n\nThis attractive family home offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal choice for growing families seeking both space and convenience. The ground floor accommodation includes a spacious kitchen/dining area, a welcoming main living room, and a bright conservatory overlooking the rear garden. A unique feature of the home is the mezzanine area accessed from the living room, providing a versatile additional space that could be utilised as a home office, reading area, play space, or for a variety of other uses.\n\nThe property comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom, offering ample accommodation for modern family living.\n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a private garden providing an excellent outdoor space for relaxation, entertaining, and family activities. To the front, there is generous off-street parking and a welcoming approach to the property.\n\nCoill Mhara is widely regarded as one of Shannon's most desirable residential locations, known for its mature surroundings, family-friendly atmosphere, and convenient access to a host of local amenities. Schools, shops, sporting facilities, Shannon Town Centre, Shannon Free Zone, and transport links are all within easy reach.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, a desirable location, and excellent outdoor space, 6 Coill Mhara represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality detached family home in an established and highly regarded neighbourhood.\n\nViewing is highly recommended without delay."
      },
